<section class="www-section" id="language">
  <header class="www-section-head">
    <div>
      <p class="hara-v2-kicker">02 · Language model</p>
      <h2>Small reading rules continue into complete programs.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      Values, functions, persistent collections, explicit state, events, rendering, and effects remain inspectable. The introductory material uses the same language and runtime contracts as larger systems.
    </p>
