      <header><span>01</span><div><p class="hara-v2-kicker">Forms</p><h3>Code and data share a readable structure</h3></div></header>
      <div><p>Forms can be read, copied, transformed, checked, and evaluated without introducing a separate syntax tree format.</p><ul><li>lists</li><li>vectors</li><li>maps</li><li>symbols</li></ul></div>
