      <div><p>Evaluate bounded forms, inspect values, and revise behaviour without turning each experiment into a full rebuild.</p><ul><li>sessions</li><li>namespaces</li><li>live values</li><li>tests</li></ul></div>
      <footer><span>Guide</span><a href="/docs/create/runtime-driven-development/">Runtime-driven development →</a></footer>
    </article>
